/**
 * Central event catalog. `default = emptySet()` (strict) — an event not
 * listed here resolves to no destinations and fires `onUnrouted` (drop +
 * alert). Webview events (web-defined names) bypass this via an explicit
 * `targets` on the tracker. Generated by scanning the Dart call sites.
 */
